	(1192, 205, '_elementor_data', '[{"id":"b1e8251","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","boxed_width":{"unit":"px","size":1193,"sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":420,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"isInner":false},{"id":"3b94d6d","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column"},"elements":[{"id":"5305667","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"L\\u2019AILLEURS COMMENCE ICI!","header_size":"h1","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Courier Prime","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":55,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"500","title_color":"#FCA11F"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"700846a","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","boxed_width":{"unit":"px","size":713,"sizes":[]},"min_height":{"unit":"px","size":0,"sizes":[]},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"45","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"ae018b5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Le domaine de La Vignerie, c\\u2019est une aventure humaine, gustative et 100 % sensorielle mais bien plus encore ! \\u00c0 la base de tout cela, l\\u2019amour de la terre et de la vigne se partage et se transmet au fil des saisons\\u2026 Au coeurs de cet \\u00e9cosyst\\u00e8me, Camille imagine, cr\\u00e9e et se r\\u00e9-invente sans cesse. Passionn\\u00e9e de terroirs et de voyages, elle a plus d\\u2019un tour dans son sac ! Bienvenue au Domaine de la Vignerie\\u2026 o\\u00f9 l\\u2019ailleurs commence ici !<\\/p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","text_color":"#000000"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]'),
